# Looking back from the city through the doorway, then turning left until you face straight down
# the corridor: a second's debug reading at each step. dwp_l3 .. l5 are the slow view (Mednafen,
# 2026-11-04: 30 fps, poly ~285, cpu 95%, VDP1 busy 90; the backlog's "Looking back down the
# corridor from the city"). Film it: tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps doorway_perf.steps
wait_up
hold up 13
hold l 3
keydown up
wait 1.8
keyup up
wait 0.5
# city_turn.steps' turn, its shots included: a turn eases on between presses, so the pauses count
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
shot dwp_turn
hold right 0.2
# The turn doesn't land the same each run: back left a little, to face the doorway
hold left 0.3
wait 2.5
shot dwp_00
wait 2
shot dwp_01
wait 2
shot dwp_02
# Then left in small steps, a second's reading at each
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l1
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l2
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l3
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l4
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l5
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l6
# On past the doorway to the roof beside it (dwp_l7 .. l9): the near roof fills the screen's
# bottom, a VDP1-bound view (2026-11-05: 30 fps, cpu 73%, busy 100) until the boxes' tops were cut
# at the screen's edge
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l7
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l8
hold left 0.1
wait 2.2
shot dwp_l9
